# Every source in this repository is stored and worked in with LF, including on Windows where a
# global `core.autocrlf` would otherwise smudge it to CRLF. That matters most for
# `src/abi/generated.rs`: it is a generated file, and a checkout whose line endings differ from what
# the generator writes makes `git status` report it dirty immediately after a faithful
# regeneration — which teaches people to ignore a signal that is supposed to mean "the tables and
# the spec disagree".
#
# The `*` is load-bearing: git reads the first whitespace-separated word of each line as the
# pattern, so a line that begins with `text` sets an attribute on a file named "text" and quietly
# applies to nothing else.
* text eol=lf

# Not text: nothing here should be converted, and a diff of these is meaningless anyway.
*.png binary
*.bin binary
